---
import AppShell from '../layouts/AppShell.astro';
---
<AppShell title="Settings" section="Settings"><div class="page-title"><div><h1>Settings & policies</h1><p>Resolved configuration, effective values, and where each rule comes from.</p></div><button class="btn primary">Save policy version</button></div><div class="settings-layout"><nav class="settings-nav" aria-label="Settings sections">{['General','Workflow profiles','Gates','Git & delivery','Security','Budgets','Retention','Notifications','About'].map((name,index)=><a class={index===0?'active':''} href={`#${name.toLowerCase().replaceAll(' ','-').replace('&','and')}`}>{name}</a>)}</nav><div class="stack"><section class="card" id="general"><div class="card-head"><h2>General</h2><span class="pill muted">effective configuration</span></div><div class="setting-row"><div><strong>Default profile</strong><p>Controls workflow stages and review strictness.</p></div><div><select class="select" aria-label="Default profile"><option>standard</option><option>fast</option><option>strict</option></select><div class="source">Source: Turtle Flow</div></div></div><div class="setting-row"><div><strong>Project branch</strong><p>Base branch for new jobs and protected delivery.</p></div><div><input class="input" aria-label="Project branch" value="main"/><div class="source">Source: repository</div></div></div></section><section class="card" id="workflow-profiles"><div class="card-head"><h2>Workflow profiles</h2></div><div class="setting-row"><div><strong>Standard</strong><p>Scope and acceptance approvals, independent review.</p></div><span class="pill success">active</span></div><div class="setting-row"><div><strong>Max fix iterations</strong><p>After the limit, a job is blocked for manual resolution.</p></div><input class="input" type="number" min="1" max="10" value="3" aria-label="Max fix iterations"/></div></section><section class="card" id="gates"><div class="card-head"><h2>Quality gates</h2></div>{['build · cargo build --workspace','test · cargo test --workspace','lint · cargo clippy --workspace','secret_scan · enabled'].map(line=><div class="setting-row"><strong>{line}</strong><span class="source">Source: repository</span></div>)}</section><section class="card" id="git-and-delivery"><div class="card-head"><h2>Git & delivery</h2></div><div class="setting-row"><div><strong>Protected branch</strong><p>Changes enter main through a pull request.</p></div><span>main · default</span></div><div class="setting-row"><div><strong>Protected paths</strong><p>Changes require acknowledgement at acceptance.</p></div><code>Cargo.lock, .github/**</code></div></section><section class="card" id="security"><div class="card-head"><h2>Security</h2></div><div class="setting-row"><div><strong>Tighten-only repo policy</strong><p>Repository configuration can add restrictions, not relax organization rules.</p></div><span class="pill success">enforced</span></div><div class="notice warning">Attempted relaxation in a repo file is ignored. The effective value stays at the stricter policy.</div></section><section class="card" id="budgets"><div class="card-head"><h2>Budgets</h2></div><div class="setting-row"><div><strong>Monthly soft limit</strong><p>Warns when combined usage approaches the limit.</p></div><input class="input" aria-label="Monthly soft limit" value="60,000,000 tokens"/></div></section><section class="card" id="retention"><div class="card-head"><h2>Retention</h2></div><div class="setting-row"><div><strong>Raw transcripts</strong><p>Summaries remain after raw blobs expire.</p></div><span>90 days · default</span></div></section><section class="card" id="notifications"><div class="card-head"><h2>Notifications</h2></div><div class="setting-row"><div><strong>Approval needed</strong><p>Desktop notification when a decision is requested.</p></div><label><input type="checkbox" checked/> Enabled</label></div></section><section class="card" id="about"><div class="card-head"><h2>About</h2></div><div class="card-body">Turtle Flow dashboard · frontend preview · mock adapter</div></section></div></div></AppShell>
